  "description": "Bright spacious modern apartment on the second floor of Richmond Hall in this highly sought after Mount St Annes development. The property has access to the LUAS Milltown stop via a private residents' gate making for an easy commute to Dublin City Centre or South Dublin/Sandyford.  Apartment is fitted and furnished to a high standard.   Accommodation comprises living/dining room with fully-fitted modern kitchen with integrated appliances; two very large bedrooms (master en suite) with fitted wardrobes and two bathrooms; a separate utility room off the hallway which offers plenty of additional storage.   A particularly attractive feature is the south-facing balcony with wonderful views.   Gas-fired central heating.  One designated parking space in secure underground carpark.  Available to let immediately on 12-month lease.",
